{"id":"98b1207c207b95df","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness.md","title":"Theorem 2A: Incompleteness Relative to an Enumeration Map","display":"thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness — Theorem 2A: Incompleteness Relative to an Enumeration Map","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness — Theorem 2A: Incompleteness Relative to an Enumeration Map","source":"第 XI 章 p. 128，Theorem 2A（PDF 145）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable]]","[[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness — Theorem 2A: Incompleteness Relative to an Enumeration Map"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 128，Theorem 2A（PDF 145）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5f2d99ce132fb68\" href=\"?note=c5f2d99ce132fb68\" title=\"92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable\">92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40e368f900e65306\" href=\"?note=40e368f900e65306\" title=\"92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness\">92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S\">\\(\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in S\">\\(\\gamma\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in P\">\\((\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in P\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSys},\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSys},\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\\)</span> 及派生联结词见上述兼容的抽象系统节点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\gamma\\notin P,\\\\\n\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\gamma\\notin P,\\\\\n\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Adequacy 先给出 Normal。相容时若 γ∈P，Normal 给出 Bγ∈P，固定点与经典 Type1 推理给出 ¬Bγ∈P，从而 f∈P，矛盾。这证明第一项，不借用 Stable。</p>\n<p>相对 ω 相容加枚举条件给出 Stable，并由 Type1 给出 Con。因而 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40e368f900e65306\" href=\"?note=40e368f900e65306\" title=\"92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness\">92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness</a> 的全部条件成立，得到 ¬γ∉P（同时也得 γ∉P）。这精确对应原书 Theorem 2A 的两个分开的结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable","status":"resolved","id":"c5f2d99ce132fb68","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"40e368f900e65306","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"40e368f900e65306","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"相对 ω 相容加枚举条件给出 Stable，并由 Type1 给出 Con。因而 [[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]] 的全部条件成立，得到 ¬γ∉P（同时也得 γ∉P）。这精确对应原书 Theorem 2A 的两个分开的结论。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type1}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConSys},\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)&\\Longrightarrow\\gamma\\notin P,\\\\\n\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}&\\Longrightarrow\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]] → [[92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness]]；[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]] → [[92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable]] → [[92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness]]。这里的真固定点与可证固定点、Φ 枚举与外部 c.e. 枚举分别保留。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["c5f2d99ce132fb68","40e368f900e65306"]}